          "before": "[Informativni list USTR iz februarja 2026](https://ustr.gov/about/policy-offices/press-office/fact-sheets/2026/february/fact-sheet-us-taiwan-agreement-reciprocal-trade) opisuje namere ZDA in Tajvana glede čezmejnih naložb ter možnost ameriške podpore financiranju zasebnih naložb na Tajvanu po veljavnih predpisih.",
          "after": "[Informativni list USTR iz februarja 2026](https://ustr.gov/about/policy-offices/press-office/fact-sheets/2026/february/fact-sheet-us-taiwan-agreement-reciprocal-trade) opisuje namere ZDA in Tajvana glede čezmejnih naložb. Ameriška stran je napovedala, da bo, kadar je to primerno, razmislila o podpori financiranju naložb v ključnih sektorjih na Tajvanu v sodelovanju z ameriškimi zasebnimi partnerji in po veljavnih predpisih.",
          "offset": 5539,
          "beforeSHA": "f1a83d6168304647b8969bc70056cfa301fb91f9b4e5c754465bd61b7086cadb",
          "afterSHA": "a6589e8395d4f32408c1c194a26f54a9b87f5aaa944db14e6a1f7f1d64858957",
          "reason": "Short current paragraph faithfully summarizes the accepted EN source as a possibility, does not promise all-investor eligibility, and immediately denies individual approval/full treaty entry into force. Therefore missing detail alone is not a blocking error. The official February statement is more specific about appropriate consideration, critical sectors and US private-sector collaboration; the optional wording makes those bounds visible.",
